WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.370
This is Drift, an Earth trend atlas for NASA Space Apps.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.750
Pick a NASA record, a season, and any span of years.

3
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.580
Drift then tests sixteen thousand places for a real trend, right in your browser.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.600
The Arctic is warming more than three times faster than the planet as a whole.

5
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:21.010
Rainfall rises in some regions and falls in others. Faded cells could just be noise.

6
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:26.530
Case files, a guided tour, and NASA POWER data make anyone an Earth data detective.

7
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.750
Drift. Find out what's really changing.
